e had on Dagobah  and the Empire Strikes Back where he  duels someone he thinks is Darth Vader  only to realize it was himself Luke  Skywalker may not have featured heavily  in the expanded universe but the idea of  an evil Luke clone whose creation came  about thanks to one of the most iconic  scenes in the franchise is undeniably  awesome  not every Skywalker story in the  expanded universe revolved around Luke  Leia also got some love in the EU and  she got to do some pretty cool stuff in  the books and comics that her on-screen  counterpart could only dream of and one  of Laius best stories that will never  make it to the big screen is the  adventure she took in Marvel Comics Star  Wars number 73 which was published  roughly two months after the release of  Return of the Jedi in 1983 the story  dubbed flaws Bane after the planet on  which it takes place picks up not long  after the Battle of Endor Leia Luke  Lando Chewbacca r2d2 and c3po are all  still hanging out together though Han  Solo had gone missing at the time and  I recently picked up a new ally a pink  skin female thief named Danny the gang  heads to the planet Lau's Maine to  search for the flight record of a rebel  pilot who crashed there and they learned  the records they need are located across  a vast canyon Leia and Danny hatch a  plan to secretly secure the records  themselves so under cover of night the  two women cross the canyon and a pair of  hot-air balloons okay yes this story is  ridiculous but the idea of Leia going on  a female-only adventure to prove her  worth even in a hot-air balloon would  have been fun to see on the silver  screen if there's one thing Star Wars  desperately needs it's a Jedi pirate and  that's exactly what kate skywalker is  debuting in Dark Horse's Star Wars  legacy comics Kate story takes place  many years after the exploits of our  traditional Star Wars heroes over a  hundred years after in fact as kate is  the great-great grandson of luke  skywalker  and since